{"id": "001", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["tempering", "domain_term_without_material"], "raw_text": "O cliente quer aumentar a produção da linha de têmpera. Hoje processam 400 chapas por dia e precisam chegar a 650. O forno atual é de 2007. Tem 12 metros de espaço disponível. Orçamento aproximado de 1.2 milhão de dólares. Precisam estar operando até março.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["increase", "raise", "upgrade"]], "constraint_kinds": ["space", "budget", "throughput", "deadline"], "min_open_questions": 8, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"dimensions": ["dimensions"], "batchingsize": ["batching size"], "productionspeed": ["production speed"], "furnacetype": ["furnace type"], "furnacebrand": ["furnace brand"], "furnacemodel": ["furnace model"], "productionlist": ["production list"], "dwglayout": ["dwg layout"], "glasstype": ["glass type"], "drillorcutout": ["drill or cutout"], "floorspace": ["floor space"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "002", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["tempering", "ambiguous_number", "no_target_number"], "raw_text": "Precisamos de um forno de têmpera novo. A gente faz umas 600 chapas por dia, às vezes mais quando entra pedido de obra grande. Vidro de 4 a 10 mm, a maioria incolor, mas está crescendo o pedido de low-e. O forno de hoje dá muita quebra e o vidro sai com ondulação de rolo, e o cliente final reclama.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": ["furnace"], "constraint_kinds": ["throughput", "technical", "other"], "min_open_questions": 7, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions"], "quantidade de peças por enfornada": ["pieces per batch"], "M² por enfornada": ["M² per batch", "square meter per batch", "square meters per batch", "square metres per batch", "m2", "sqm"], "Tipo do forno": ["furnace type", "furnace function"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Espessura do vidro": ["glass thickness"]}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "003", "lang": "en", "tags": ["tempering", "upgrade_vs_replace"], "raw_text": "We run a horizontal tempering furnace on two shifts and want to add heat-strengthened glass to the product mix, mainly for façade projects. The current furnace takes a maximum load of 2.44 x 4.2 m. We'd like to know whether the existing line can be upgraded (convection, controls) or whether we need a new one. Glass is 6 to 12 mm, mostly soft-coat low-e. No budget set yet.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": ["upgrade", "new"], "constraint_kinds": ["regulatory", "other", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "low", "must_ask_topics": {"Quanto dura o turno": ["shift duration", "shift lasts", "shift takes"], "Marca do forno": ["furnace manufacturer", "furnace brand"], "Modelo do forno": ["furnace model"], "Dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions", "length", "width", "height"], "Qual é o objetivo": ["goal", "achieve"], "Qual o orçamento": ["budget"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"espessura": ["thickness"]}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "004", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["laminating", "explicit_budget", "explicit_space", "explicit_deadline"], "raw_text": "Queremos começar a fazer vidro laminado. Hoje compramos de terceiros, uns 1.500 m² por mês, e o prazo de entrega do fornecedor está atrasando nossas obras. Pensamos numa linha com sala limpa e autoclave. O galpão tem uma área livre de 30 x 18 m. Interlayer PVB, talvez SGP no futuro. Investimento máximo de R$ 8 milhões. Queremos estar produzindo antes do fim do ano que vem.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": ["laminated", "new", "autoclave"], "constraint_kinds": ["space", "technical", "budget", "deadline", "throughput"], "min_open_questions": 2, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions", "glass sizes"], "Espessura do vidro antes de laminar": ["thickness before lamination"], "Espessura do vidro depois de laminar": ["thickness after lamination"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"O galpão tem uma área livre de 30 x 18 m": ["space", "floor space", "space available"], "Interlayer PVB, talvez SGP no futuro": ["interlayer"], "Investimento máximo de R$ 8 milhões": ["what is the budget", "what is your budget", "what is the available budget", "what budget", "budget range", "how much can you invest", "how much is available"], "Queremos estar produzindo antes do fim do ano que vem": ["what is the deadline", "when must", "when do you need", "when should", "required date", "target date"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "005", "lang": "en", "tags": ["laminating", "conflicting_needs"], "raw_text": "Management wants to double laminated output without adding headcount, and at the same time start producing curved laminated glass for a transport contract. The current line is manual lay-up with a 2.5 x 5 m autoclave running about three cycles a day. The building cannot be extended.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": ["double", "curved"], "constraint_kinds": ["regulatory", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Quantidade de produção": ["amount of pieces", "production"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Quantos turnos": ["amount of shifts"], "Quanto tempo de turno": ["shift duration"], "Tipo de interlayer": ["interlayer"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "006", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["cutting", "no_target_number"], "raw_text": "A mesa de corte manual virou gargalo. Cortamos float de 2 a 19 mm, chapas jumbo de 3,21 x 6,00 m. Queremos automatizar o corte e a quebra, com otimização do plano de corte integrada ao ERP. Hoje perdemos em torno de 12% do vidro em retalho e queremos baixar isso.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["Automate", "automation", "automating", "optimization", "optimisation", "ERP integration", "integrated with the ERP", "ERP-integrated"], ["reduce loss", "reducing loss", "reduce glass loss"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical", "regulatory"], "min_open_questions": 1, "confidence": "high", "must_ask_topics": {"marcação à laser": ["laser marking"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions"], "Tipo do vidro": ["glass type"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "007", "lang": "en", "tags": ["cutting", "ambiguous_number", "jargon"], "raw_text": "Need a cutting table for laminated glass, 33.1 to 66.2. About 80 sheets a shift, maybe more. It has to fit in the existing loading bay next to the float table.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["laminated", "cutting", "table"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical", "space"], "min_open_questions": 4, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Espessura do vidro": ["glass thickness"], "duração do turno": ["shift duration"], "quantos turnos": ["amount of shifts"], "tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "tipo de interlayer": ["interlayer"], "layout em dwg": ["layout"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions", "glass sizes"], "Quantidade de peças por turno": ["amount of pieces per shift"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "008", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["insulating", "budget_range", "derived_rate_bait"], "raw_text": "Linha de insulado: hoje montamos tudo à mão, cerca de 120 unidades por dia, com espaçador de alumínio e butil mais polissulfeto. Devemos fechar uma obra de 9.000 unidades de vidro duplo com argônio, com entrega em 8 meses, e a construtora exige espaçador warm-edge. A linha precisa estar rodando em 4 meses para cumprir a entrega. O orçamento ainda não foi aprovado, mas a diretoria falou em algo entre 2 e 3 milhões de reais.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["insulated", "insulating", "insulation"]], "constraint_kinds": ["deadline", "budget", "throughput", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 4, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["glass dimensions"], "Dimensões do IGU": ["IGU dimensions", "insulated glass dimensions", "insulated glass unit dimensions", "insulated dimensions", "insulated piece dimensions", "insulating glass dimensions", "insulating glass unit dimensions", "insulating dimensions", "insulating piece dimensions"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout", "dwg"], "Vai ter gás argônio": ["argon"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Prazo": ["what is the deadline", "when must", "when do you need", "when should", "required date", "target date"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "009", "lang": "en", "tags": ["insulating", "ambiguous_number"], "raw_text": "Our customers are moving to triple glazing for colder markets. The current IGU line only handles double units, max 2.0 x 3.0 m. We need triple capability, argon filling and automatic secondary sealing. Volume target is ~300 units a day across two shifts.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["triple IGU", "triple glazing", "triple insulating", "triple insulated"]], "constraint_kinds": ["throughput", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 4, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Taxa de gás argônio": ["gas rate", "argon rate", "argon gas rate"], "Marca da linha atual": ["brand"], "Modelo da linha atual": ["model"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Quantidade de camadas": ["layers", "glazing"], "Selante secundário": ["automatic secondary sealing", "automatic secondary sealant", "is secondary sealing required", "do you need secondary sealing"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "010", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["screen_printing", "vague_volume"], "raw_text": "Queremos trazer a serigrafia para dentro de casa. Hoje mandamos imprimir fora vidros de fachada com pontilhado e alguns tampos de fogão. O volume é pequeno, mas o prazo do terceirizado é de 3 semanas. Precisamos de impressão e secagem, integradas antes da têmpera.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["Screen printing", "screen-printing", "screen printer", "screen print"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical", "other"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Cores": ["colors", "colours"], "Tipo do vidro": ["glass type"], "Quantidade de peças": ["amount of pieces", "amount of glass", "amount of glass pieces"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Precisa de secagem": ["is drying required", "do you need drying", "need drying", "drying required", "drying needed"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "011", "lang": "en", "tags": ["screen_printing", "conflicting_needs"], "raw_text": "We're torn between a screen printing line and a digital ceramic printer. Sales wants full-colour decorative panels in small batches; production wants something fast for the standard white border on appliance glass, which is 90% of our volume. Whatever we buy has to sit before the tempering furnace and dry the enamel in-line.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["Screen printing", "digital printing", "screen-printing", "screen printer", "digital printer", "digital ceramic printer"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical"], "min_open_questions": 4, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Quantidade de cores": ["colors", "colours"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "012", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["too_short", "domain_term_without_material"], "raw_text": "Orçamento para forno de têmpera.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["tempering furnace", "furnace", "tempering", "temper"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "low", "must_ask_topics": {"Capacidade de produção": ["capacity", "production"], "Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Tipo do forno": ["furnace type", "tempering furnace type"], "Tamanho da enfornada": ["batch size", "batching size", "loading size", "load size"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "013", "lang": "en", "tags": ["too_short", "insulating"], "raw_text": "Need an IG line quote asap.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["IG line", "insulating line", "insulated line", "IGU line", "insulated glass line", "insulating glass line", "IG production line", "insulating glass production line", "insulating glass (IG) line"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "low", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Tipo de espaçador": ["spacer type"], "Selante secundário": ["secondary sealant", "secondary sealing"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Produção desejada": ["production goal", "desired production"], "Velocidade da linha": ["speed"], "Taxa de argônio": ["argon gas", "gas", "argon", "argon rate", "argon gas rate"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "014", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["vague_objective", "multi_process"], "raw_text": "Estamos com problemas na fábrica. Muita quebra, o pessoal reclama da mesa de corte, a têmpera atrasa os pedidos e o insulado fica parado esperando vidro. Queria ver o que vocês têm para melhorar isso tudo.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [], "constraint_kinds": ["technical"], "min_open_questions": 8, "confidence": "low", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Produção desejada": ["production goal", "desired production"], "Modelo das máquinas": ["model"], "Marca das máquinas": ["manufacturer", "brand"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Lista de produção": ["production list", "production table", "production sheet"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "015", "lang": "en", "tags": ["vague_objective"], "raw_text": "Saw your booth at the trade fair. We're a mid-size processor doing tempering, some lamination and IG units. Thinking about modernising at some point next year. Send whatever information you have.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["modernise", "modernising", "modernisation", "modernize", "modernization", "modernizing"], ["automate", "automation", "automating"]], "constraint_kinds": ["technical"], "min_open_questions": 8, "confidence": "low", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Produção desejada": ["production goal", "desired production"], "Modelo das máquinas": ["model"], "Marca das máquinas": ["manufacturer", "brand"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Lista de produção": ["production list", "production table", "production sheet"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "016", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["tempering", "conflicting_needs"], "raw_text": "O dono quer a linha de têmpera nova operando em 60 dias, com orçamento máximo de R$ 1,5 milhão. Precisa temperar até 19 mm em chapa de 3,2 x 6 m, porque estamos perdendo pedidos de vidro de fachada de grande formato.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": ["new"], "constraint_kinds": ["deadline", "budget", "technical", "other"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Furação": ["drilling"], "Recorte": ["Cutout", "milling", "cut-out", "cut out"], "Precisa de forno de têmpera": ["furnace", "tempering"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Prazo": ["what is the deadline", "when must", "when do you need", "when should", "required date", "target date"], "Orçamento": ["what is the budget", "what is your budget", "what is the available budget", "what budget", "budget range", "how much can you invest", "how much is available"]}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "017", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["laminating", "relative_target"], "raw_text": "Queremos aumentar em 30% a capacidade da laminação. O forno de pré-laminação atual é o gargalo; a sala limpa e a autoclave ainda têm folga.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["increase", "raise"], ["laminated", "laminate", "lamination", "laminating"]], "constraint_kinds": ["throughput", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Produção desejada": ["production goal", "desired production"], "Modelo das máquinas": ["model"], "Marca das máquinas": ["manufacturer", "brand"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Lista de produção": ["production list", "production table", "production sheet"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Tipo de interlayer": ["interlayer"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"capacidade desejada": ["throughput"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "018", "lang": "en", "tags": ["tempering", "uk_terminology"], "raw_text": "We want to replace our toughening plant. It's 25 years old and the quench struggles with 4 mm glass. The line has to keep running during installation; we can only stop for two weeks in August.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["replace", "replacing"]], "constraint_kinds": ["regulatory", "technical"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Espessura do vidro": ["thickness"], "Produção desejada": ["production goal", "desired production"], "Modelo das máquinas": ["model"], "Marca das máquinas": ["manufacturer", "brand"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Lista de produção": ["production list", "production table", "production sheet"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {}, "forbidden_terms": ["harden", "steel", "metallurg", "oil"]}}
{"id": "019", "lang": "pt", "tags": ["insulating", "ambiguous_deadline", "ambiguous_number"], "raw_text": "Uma fabricante de esquadrias pede insulado com vidro temperado e low-e, composição 6+12+6, em média 40 m² por dia, com picos de 70. Temos a têmpera, falta o insulado. O espaço seria o antigo depósito, uns 25 m de comprimento. Querem preço até o fim do mês.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["insulated", "insulating", "insulation", "IGU", "IG line", "IGU line", "IG production line", "insulated glass line", "insulating glass line", "insulating glass production line", "insulating glass (IG) line"]], "constraint_kinds": ["space", "deadline", "throughput", "regulatory"], "min_open_questions": 5, "confidence": "medium", "must_ask_topics": {"Dimensões do vidro": ["dimensions"], "Layout em dwg": ["layout"], "Lista de produção": ["production list", "production table", "production sheet"], "Tipo de espaçador": ["spacer type"], "Precisa de selante secundário": ["secondary sealant", "secondary sealing"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Taxa de gás argônio": ["gas rate", "argon rate", "argon gas rate"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Espaço disponível": ["area"], "Prazo para cotação": ["what is the deadline", "when must", "when do you need", "when should", "required date", "target date"], "Produção": ["throughput"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
{"id": "020", "lang": "en", "tags": ["screen_printing", "fully_specified"], "raw_text": "Request for a screen printing line for appliance glass (oven doors and cooktops), 3 to 6 mm, maximum size 1,200 x 800 mm. Target is 1,800 pieces per 8-hour shift, single-colour black enamel, followed by IR drying. Today we print on manual tables, around 700 pieces per shift. Available floor space is 22 x 6 m. Budget USD 450,000. Commissioning required by the end of Q3.", "expected": {"objective_keywords": [["Screen printing", "screen-printing", "screen printer", "screen print"]], "constraint_kinds": ["throughput", "budget", "space", "deadline", "technical", "other"], "min_open_questions": 3, "confidence": "high", "must_ask_topics": {"Layout em dwg": ["layout"]}, "must_not_ask_topics": {"Capacidade desejada": ["throughput"], "Orçamento disponível": ["what is the budget", "what is your budget", "what is the available budget", "what budget", "budget range", "how much can you invest", "how much is available"], "Espaço disponível": ["how much floor space", "what floor space", "what is the available floor space", "how much space"], "Prazo": ["what is the deadline", "when must", "when do you need", "when should", "required date", "target date"], "Tipo de vidro": ["glass type"], "Capacidade atual": ["current capacity"]}, "forbidden_terms": []}}
